# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 忘川检索 fhlSearch · 仓库根目录属性
# （各平台子目录另有自己的 .gitattributes，子目录规则优先）
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# 默认按文本处理，仓库内统一 LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# ---- 二进制：不做换行转换、不做 diff ----
*.png      binary
*.jpg      binary
*.jpeg     binary
*.gif      binary
*.ico      binary
*.icns     binary

# ---- 各端编译产物 ----
*.exe      binary
*.apk      binary
*.hap      binary
*.aab      binary
*.jar      binary
*.dll      binary
*.so       binary

# ---- 题库数据 ----
*.xlsx     binary
*.xls      binary

# ---- 签名与证书：绝不入库，这里再兜一层 ----
*.jks      binary
*.keystore binary
*.p12      binary
*.cer      binary
*.p7b      binary
